vectorwake (criccomini, push to main): a Subspace-inspired MMO with our own art. Deterministic C99 core, Rust authoritative server, Defold client. Zones own their rules and send them over the wire: one weapon model, a tech tree, bounty derived from what you hold.                        
Faithfulness to the original settled the numbers, the map, and mobile controls; then vectorwake shipped to Vultr and playing it found what no check could.                                                                                                                                     
From quietly broken fleet to a game worth playing: live failures swept, offline mode dropped, bots live and then rewritten, maps converted, sound and interface built, and the build-out era after go-live through oriented collision, an authoritative kill feed, iOS, and teams.             
